{"id":"573d6ccf155d773c","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-arithmetization-steps.md","title":"Arithmetization Steps","display":"df-arithmetization-steps — Arithmetization Steps","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-arithmetization-steps","aliases":["92-df-arithmetization-steps"],"display":"df-arithmetization-steps — Arithmetization Steps","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-arithmetization-steps"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-arithmetization-steps</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetization-steps — Arithmetization Steps"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((p_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (increasing enumeration of the primes, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0=2\">\\(p_0=2\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeqCode},\\mathrm{SeqDec},C_{\\mathrm{seq}}\">\\(\\mathrm{SeqCode},\\mathrm{SeqDec},C_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\)</span> (definition-target sequence coding data)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetization\\text{-}steps} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{SeqCode}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle n_0,\\ldots,n_{k-1}\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i&lt;k}p_i^{n_i+1},\\\\\n&amp;C_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{SeqCode}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{SeqDec}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SeqCode}^{-1}:C_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\to\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetization\\text{-}steps} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{SeqCode}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle n_0,\\ldots,n_{k-1}\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i&lt;k}p_i^{n_i+1},\\\\\n&amp;C_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{SeqCode}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{SeqDec}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SeqCode}^{-1}:C_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\to\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>算术化步骤详细</li>\n<li>步骤1：固定符号编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:\\Sigma_G\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(c:\\Sigma_G\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>（本书中例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(\\forall)=9\">\\(c(\\forall)=9\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>步骤2：用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i&lt;k}p_i^{n_i+1}\">\\(\\prod_{i&lt;k}p_i^{n_i+1}\\)</span> 编码有限数列</li>\n<li>步骤3：公式是符号序列</li>\n<li>步骤4：证明是公式序列</li>\n<li>步骤5：定义PR谓词（公理检验、规则检验）</li>\n<li>对这里固定的素数幂编码，合法码识别、长度和各分量读取均可实现为 PR；具体公式与证明检验仍需分别证明</li>\n<li>Gödel编码的完整过程</li>\n<li>空序列编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeqDec}\">\\(\\mathrm{SeqDec}\\)</span> 只在合法序列码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathrm{seq}}\">\\(C_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\)</span> 上取值</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"(p_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"p_0=2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SeqCode},\\mathrm{SeqDec},C_{\\mathrm{seq}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetization\\text{-}steps} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{SeqCode}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N_{>0},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle n_0,\\ldots,n_{k-1}\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i<k}p_i^{n_i+1},\\\\\n&C_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{SeqCode}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{SeqDec}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SeqCode}^{-1}:C_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\to\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"c:\\Sigma_G\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"c(\\forall)=9","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_{i<k}p_i^{n_i+1}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SeqDec}","display":false},{"tex":"C_{\\mathrm{seq}}","display":false}],"bytes":1515,"backlinks":[{"id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SeqCode}$ (finite-sequence encoder, see [[92-df-arithmetization-steps]])"},{"id":"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SeqDec}$ (sequence decoder on legal codes, see [[92-df-arithmetization-steps]])"},{"id":"e71305ac139aeef7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SeqCode}$ (finite-sequence encoder, see [[92-df-arithmetization-steps]])"},{"id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SeqCode}$ (sequence encoder, see [[92-df-arithmetization-steps]])"},{"id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SeqCode}$ (finite-sequence encoder, see [[92-df-arithmetization-steps]])"},{"id":"2ed5fae1d0439ed4","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SeqCode}$ (finite-sequence encoder, see [[92-df-arithmetization-steps]])"},{"id":"8773b1cdac488c9d","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SeqCode}$ (finite-sequence encoder, see [[92-df-arithmetization-steps]])"},{"id":"6c4d7648de3418cf","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SeqCode},\\mathrm{SeqDec}$ (finite-s